  "summary": "Skye Kakoschke-Moore, a senator from the Nick Xenophon Team, announced her resignation due to possessing dual British citizenship inherited from her mother. Born in Darwin in 1985 to a mother who acquired British citizenship by being born in Singapore when it was a British colony, Kakoschke-Moore was unknowingly a British citizen. Her resignation follows advice confirming her citizenship status from the UK Home Office and a specialist barrister. She plans to have her case referred to the high court to decide how her Senate vacancy will be filled and aims to continue her political career with the NXT, despite the situation presented by a recent similar high court decision."
}
